; Actual prime-residue one/product nonvanishing proofs
; construct the coefficient-domain fields. A composite or unit modulus
; does not acquire these fields merely by having a ring instance.
(#alias finite-prime-one-nonzero = ./finite-prime-inverses.lim::finite-prime-one-nonzero)
